id: pm-003j
title: "Scorecard Token-Permissions (0→10): declare least-privilege top-level permissions in every GitHub workflow"
description: Raise OpenSSF Scorecard Token-Permissions to 10 by declaring explicit least-privilege permissions in every workflow and limiting elevations to the jobs that require them.
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: github-actions,least-privilege,scorecard,security
created_at: "2026-07-14T22:40:26.943Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-24T01:06:20.498Z"
