completed_at: "2026-09-24T01:06:19.699Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: "Every workflow under .github/workflows declares an explicit top-level permissions block (least privilege, job-level elevation only where required, matching the scorecard.yml/security.yml pattern); actionlint + Trivy misconfig green; next Scorecard run reports Token-Permissions 10"
parent: pm-gnzh
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: Scope CodSpeed OIDC and Nightly issue writes to consuming jobs; register a blocking read-only workflow-default gate in static quality and the gate inventory.
expected_result: "All workflow defaults are read-only, job elevations are explicit, negative control fails, Actionlint and security gates pass."
actual_result: "Prior-main Scorecard Token-Permissions 10; Actionlint, bounded Trivy, tracked-secret scan, gate registry, and 11 focused registry/workflow tests pass; write-grant negative control exits 1. PR-head hosted checks remain pending."
